[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A      • \u001b[1mAcoustic Limiting:\u001b[m Test tone generation is clamped at -20 dBFS with \u001b]8;id=jk13c9614a6d6e1580;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Utility/dsp.h#L115\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4my\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m:\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m:\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mS\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mf\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mL\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mm\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ and\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3427cc809946f2cb;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Utility/dcblock.h#L18\u0007daisysp::DcBlock\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mPhase 0: Non-Destructive Firmware Backup\u001b[m\n\u001b[39D• Boot into STM32 ROM DFU via \u001b[94mBOOT\u001b[m + \u001b[94mRESET\u001b[m.\n\u001b[43D• Check RDP protection level; dump Internal Flash (128 KB @ \u001b[94m0x080\u001b[5b\u001b[m) and QSPI Flash (8 MB @ \u001b[94m0x90\u001b[6b\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[6Cvia \u001b[94mdfu-util\u001b[m.\n\u001b[13D• Archive SHA-256 hashes and analyze binary strings for peripheral identifiers.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mPhase 1: Safe Tooling & Non-Blocking USB CDC Shell\u001b[m\n\u001b[49D• Ta"]
[0.000, "o", "rget Gamma's USB-C port routed to pins \u001b[94mD29\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD30\u001b[m (\u001b[94mUsbHandle::FS_EXTERNAL\u001b[m).\n\u001b[76D• Implement a microsecond-guarded non-blocking logger using \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf12927c82a3646a7;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/sys/system.h\u0007System::GetUs()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to eliminate the \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkedf4b5e105fa20e8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/hid/logger.h#L192\u0007Logger\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[99Dsynchronous deadlock hazard.\r\n  4. \u001b[1mPhase 2: I2C Bus Scanning & Subsystem Detection\u001b[m\n\u001b[46D• Execute SCL bus-recovery clocking (9 pulses to clear hung SDA lines).\n\u001b[71D• Sweep 7-bit addresses (\u001b[94m0x08\u001b[m to \u001b[94m0x77\u001b[m) using \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk86237234444d12ea;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/per/i2c.h#L25\u0007I2CHandle\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to detect OLED displays (\u001b[94m0x3C\u001b[m/\u001b[94m0x3D\u001b[m), port expanders\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94m0x20\u001b[m–\u001b[94m0x27\u001b[m), or touch ICs (\u001b[94m0x5A\u001b[m–\u001b[94m0x5D\u001b[m).\r\n  5. \u001b[1mPhase 3: ADC Potentiometer & Joystick Mapping\u001b[m\n\u001b[44D• Configure all 14 analog channels (\u001b[94mA"]
[0.000, "o", "0\u001b[m–\u001b[94mA11\u001b[m plus Daisy Seed 2 DFM pins \u001b[94mA12\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD31\u001b[m and \u001b[94mA13\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD32\u001b[m) via \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk80597f6fcc61d7d4;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/per/adc.h#L10\u0007AdcHandle\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\u001b[6C• Stream 16-bit raw values to identify rotary pots, self-centering joysticks, and floating lines; condition\r\n\u001b[6Cwith \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf0e1064d80b8e4d3;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/hid/parameter.h#L19\u0007daisysp::Parameter\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3f03ee47ac04ab07;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Utility/dsp.h#L113\u0007daisysp::fmap\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  6. \u001b[1mPhase 4: Digital Key & Matrix Scanning\u001b[m\n\u001b[37D• Differentiate direct active-low GPIO buttons from row/column multiplexed matrices.\n\u001b[84D• Debounce inputs at 1 kHz in the control loop using \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2ab1daf2515c8d2f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/hid/switch.h#L18\u0007daisy::Switch\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  7. \u001b[1mPhase 5: Audio Codec & Amplifier Enable Discovery\u001b[m\n\u001b[48D• Verify hardware [PCM30\r\n\n⣯"]
