[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A  2. \u001b[1mPhase 0: Non-Destructive Firmware Backup\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6C• Boot into STM32 ROM DFU via \u001b[94mBOOT\u001b[m + \u001b[94mRESET\u001b[m.\n\u001b[43D• Check RDP protection level; dump Internal Flash (128 KB @ \u001b[94m0x080\u001b[5b\u001b[m) and QSPI Flash (8 MB @ \u001b[94m0x90\u001b[6b\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[6Cvia \u001b[94mdfu-util\u001b[m.\n\u001b[13D• Archive SHA-256 hashes and analyze binary strings for peripheral identifiers.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mPhase 1: Safe Tooling & Non-Blocking USB CDC Shell\u001b[m\n\u001b[49D• Target Gamma's USB-C port routed to pins \u001b[94mD29\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD30\u001b[m (\u001b[94mUsbHandle::FS_EXTERNAL\u001b[m).\n\u001b[76D• Implement a microsecond-guarded non-blocking logger using \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk40a7bfdba089cf9a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/sys/system.h\u0007System::GetUs()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to eliminate the \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk57dc239728fd44f7;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/hid/logger.h#L192\u0007Logger\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[99Dsynchronous deadlock hazard.\r\n  4. \u001b[1mPhase 2: I2C Bus Scanning & Subsystem Detection\u001b[m\n\u001b[46D• Execute SCL bus-recovery clocking (9 pulses to"]
[0.000, "o", " clear hung SDA lines).\n\u001b[71D• Sweep 7-bit addresses (\u001b[94m0x08\u001b[m to \u001b[94m0x77\u001b[m) using \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfbbf38c7095213e5;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/per/i2c.h#L25\u0007I2CHandle\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to detect OLED displays (\u001b[94m0x3C\u001b[m/\u001b[94m0x3D\u001b[m), port expanders\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94m0x20\u001b[m–\u001b[94m0x27\u001b[m), or touch ICs (\u001b[94m0x5A\u001b[m–\u001b[94m0x5D\u001b[m).\r\n  5. \u001b[1mPhase 3: ADC Potentiometer & Joystick Mapping\u001b[m\n\u001b[44D• Configure all 14 analog channels (\u001b[94mA0\u001b[m–\u001b[94mA11\u001b[m plus Daisy Seed 2 DFM pins \u001b[94mA12\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD31\u001b[m and \u001b[94mA13\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD32\u001b[m) via \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3a05c98163783729;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/per/adc.h#L10\u0007AdcHandle\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\u001b[6C• Stream 16-bit raw values to identify rotary pots, self-centering joysticks, and floating lines; condition\r\n\u001b[6Cwith \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3a381f5b5dbbc242;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/hid/parameter.h#L19\u0007daisysp::Parameter\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkeeddcca8c14b13d8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Utility"]
[0.000, "o", "/dsp.h#L113\u0007daisysp::fmap\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  6. \u001b[1mPhase 4: Digital Key & Matrix Scanning\u001b[m\n\u001b[37D• Differentiate direct active-low GPIO buttons from row/column multiplexed matrices.\n\u001b[84D• Debounce inputs at 1 kHz in the control loop using \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk15c6c621e0e1d89c;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/hid/switch.h#L18\u0007daisy::Switch\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  7. \u001b[1mPhase 5: Audio Codec & Amplifier Enable Discovery\u001b[m\n\u001b[48D• Verify hardware \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk80a262ae61d4292d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/dev/codec_pcm3060.h\u0007PCM3060\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 codec initialization on SAI1 with \u001b[94mPB11\u001b[m deemphasis control.\n\u001b[84D• Start non-interleaved audio streaming with\n\u001b[44D[\u001b[94mDaisySeed::StartAudio\u001b[m](file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/daisy_see\r\n\n⢿  \u001b[90mLoading...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Use /voice (or press f5) to record your prompt with your microphone.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────"]
