[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A      via \u001b[94mdfu-util\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n      • Archive SHA-256 hashes and analyze binary strings for peripheral identifiers.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  3. \u001b[1mPhase 1: Safe Tooling & Non-Blocking USB CDC Shell\u001b[m\n\u001b[49D• Target Gamma's USB-C port routed to pins \u001b[94mD29\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD30\u001b[m (\u001b[94mUsbHandle::FS_EXTERNAL\u001b[m).\n\u001b[76D• Implement a microsecond-guarded non-blocking logger using \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9cf6925ebfc1a18e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/sys/system.h\u0007System::GetUs()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to eliminate the \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkba89748d80a0e21b;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/hid/logger.h#L192\u0007Logger\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[99Dsynchronous deadlock hazard.\r\n  4. \u001b[1mPhase 2: I2C Bus Scanning & Subsystem Detection\u001b[m\n\u001b[46D• Execute SCL bus-recovery clocking (9 pulses to clear hung SDA lines).\n\u001b[71D• Sweep 7-bit addresses (\u001b[94m0x08\u001b[m to \u001b[94m0x77\u001b[m) using \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk74865e90594be2a9;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/per/i2c.h#L25\u0007I2CHandle\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to detect OLED displays (\u001b[94m0x3C\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "m/\u001b[94m0x3D\u001b[m), port expanders\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94m0x20\u001b[m–\u001b[94m0x27\u001b[m), or touch ICs (\u001b[94m0x5A\u001b[m–\u001b[94m0x5D\u001b[m).\r\n  5. \u001b[1mPhase 3: ADC Potentiometer & Joystick Mapping\u001b[m\n\u001b[44D• Configure all 14 analog channels (\u001b[94mA0\u001b[m–\u001b[94mA11\u001b[m plus Daisy Seed 2 DFM pins \u001b[94mA12\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD31\u001b[m and \u001b[94mA13\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD32\u001b[m) via \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9baa095f5fb56aa5;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/per/adc.h#L10\u0007AdcHandle\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\u001b[6C• Stream 16-bit raw values to identify rotary pots, self-centering joysticks, and floating lines; condition\r\n\u001b[6Cwith \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk68a3c754dcdf4526;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/hid/parameter.h#L19\u0007daisysp::Parameter\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaa1efc8d2f3e5944;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Utility/dsp.h#L113\u0007daisysp::fmap\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  6. \u001b[1mPhase 4: Digital Key & Matrix Scanning\u001b[m\n\u001b[37D• Differentiate direct active-low GPIO buttons from row/column multiplexed matrices.\n\u001b[84D• Debounce inputs at 1 kHz in the control loop using \u001b"]
