[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A      • Target Gamma's USB-C port routed to pins \u001b[94mD29\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD30\u001b[m (\u001b[94mUsbHandle::FS_EXTERNAL\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6C• Implement a microsecond-guarded non-blocking logger using \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1bfff894da57baef;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/sys/system.h\u0007System::GetUs()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to eliminate the \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1c4adf3b71b730a0;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/hid/logger.h#L192\u0007Logger\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[99Dsynchronous deadlock hazard.\r\n  4. \u001b[1mPhase 2: I2C Bus Scanning & Subsystem Detection\u001b[m\n\u001b[46D• Execute SCL bus-recovery clocking (9 pulses to clear hung SDA lines).\n\u001b[71D• Sweep 7-bit addresses (\u001b[94m0x08\u001b[m to \u001b[94m0x77\u001b[m) using \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk51d4b21bf33f9a22;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/per/i2c.h#L25\u0007I2CHandle\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to detect OLED displays (\u001b[94m0x3C\u001b[m/\u001b[94m0x3D\u001b[m), port expanders\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94m0x20\u001b[m–\u001b[94m0x27\u001b[m), or touch ICs (\u001b[94m0x5A\u001b[m–\u001b[94m0x5D\u001b[m).\r\n  5. \u001b[1mPhase 3: ADC Potentiometer & Joystick Mapping\u001b[m\n\u001b[44D• Con"]
[0.000, "o", "figure all 14 analog channels (\u001b[94mA0\u001b[m–\u001b[94mA11\u001b[m plus Daisy Seed 2 DFM pins \u001b[94mA12\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD31\u001b[m and \u001b[94mA13\u001b[m/\u001b[94mD32\u001b[m) via \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkac9f17794ff04d7c;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/per/adc.h#L10\u0007AdcHandle\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\u001b[6C• Stream 16-bit raw values to identify rotary pots, self-centering joysticks, and floating lines; condition\r\n\u001b[6Cwith \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3ee71ccf4ef6421b;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/hid/parameter.h#L19\u0007daisysp::Parameter\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5981083063ba180f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Utility/dsp.h#L113\u0007daisysp::fmap\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  6. \u001b[1mPhase 4: Digital Key & Matrix Scanning\u001b[m\n\u001b[37D• Differentiate direct active-low GPIO buttons from row/column multiplexed matrices.\n\u001b[84D• Debounce inputs at 1 kHz in the control loop using \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1367f65971507837;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/hid/switch.h#L18\u0007daisy::Switch\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  7. \u001b[1mPhase 5: Audio Codec & Amplifier Enable Discovery\u001b[m\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[48D• Verify hardware \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5b8440bbab1f0afc;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/dev/codec_pcm3060.h\u0007PCM3060\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 codec initialization on SAI1 with \u001b[94mPB11\u001b[m deemphasis control.\n\u001b[84D• Start non-interleaved audio streaming with \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk49419ab6169983fc;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/libDaisy/src/daisy_seed.h#L68\u0007DaisySeed::StartAudio\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 playing a safe sine wave from\n\u001b[96D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7f5dae9f92adcb18;file:///Users/brett/tmp/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Synthesis/oscillator.h#L18\u0007daisysp::Oscillator\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\n\u001b[20D• Probe unassigned GPIOs in output mode to detect the Class-D amplifier's \u001b[94mSHDN\u001b[m/\u001b[94mEN\u001b[m pin and the 3.5mm\n\u001b[99Dheadphone detect switch.\r\n  8. \u001b[1mPhase 6: Consolidated Board Support Package (Gamma BSP)\u001b[m\n\u001b[54D• Package verified pinouts into a reusable \u001b[94mGammaBSP\u001b[m module with correct STM32H7 memory placements:\n\u001b[98D\u001b[94mDTCM_MEM_SECTION\u001b[m for DSP state, \u001b[94mDMA_BUFFER_MEM_SECTION\u001b[m in SRAM1 for DMA buffers, and \u001b[94mDSY_SDRAM_BSS\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[m in SDRAM\r\n\u001b[6Cfor\r\n\n⣽  \u001b[90mLoading\u001b[94m...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Use /voice (or press f5) to record your prompt with your microphone.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[80X\u001b[80C\u001b[2mGemini 3.8 Flash · high\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
